{"title": "Blessed Mercy", "pageid": 28577, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Blessed_Mercy", "categories": ["Passive item features", "Passive features"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<p><b>Blessed Mercy</b> is a passive feature that adds attack bonuses and saving throw bonuses when the wearer heals them.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\n<p>When you heal a creature, it gains a <span style=\"display: inline-block; width: 30px;\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/31/D4_Physical.png/31px-D4_Physical.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/31/D4_Physical.png/46px-D4_Physical.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/3/31/D4_Physical.png/62px-D4_Physical.png.webp 2x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/31/D4_Physical.png/31px-D4_Physical.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"31\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/3/31/D4_Physical.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> </span> <b>+1d4</b> bonus to <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png/25px-Attack_Roll_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png/38px-Attack_Roll_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png/50px-Attack_Roll_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Attack Roll\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png/25px-Attack_Roll_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Attack_Roll\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Attack Roll\">Attack Rolls</a> and <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png/25px-Saving_Throw_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Saving Throw\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png/25px-Saving_Throw_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Saving_Throw\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Saving Throw\">Saving Throws</a> for 2 turns. \n</p>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div>\n</div><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Condition:_Bless\"> Condition: Bless </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-condition\"><strong><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Bless_(Condition)\" title=\"Bless (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/87/Bless_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Bless_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/87/Bless_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Bless_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/87/Bless_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Bless_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Bless\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/87/Bless_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Bless_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/87/Bless_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Bless_(Condition)\" title=\"Bless (Condition)\">Bless</a></strong><p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-lightmode-drop-shadow\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/25px-Duration_Icons.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/38px-Duration_Icons.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/50px-Duration_Icons.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Duration Icons.png\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/25px-Duration_Icons.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> Duration: 2  turns</p>\n<div>\n<ul><li>Gains a <span style=\"display: inline-block; width: 30px;\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/31/D4_Physical.png/31px-D4_Physical.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/31/D4_Physical.png/46px-D4_Physical.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/3/31/D4_Physical.png/62px-D4_Physical.png.webp 2x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/31/D4_Physical.png/31px-D4_Physical.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"31\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/3/31/D4_Physical.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> </span> <b>+1d4</b> bonus to <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png/25px-Attack_Roll_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png/38px-Attack_Roll_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png/50px-Attack_Roll_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Attack Roll\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png/25px-Attack_Roll_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Attack_Roll\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Attack Roll\">Attack Rolls</a> and <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png/25px-Saving_Throw_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Saving Throw\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png/25px-Saving_Throw_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Saving_Throw\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Saving Throw\">Saving Throws</a>.</li></ul>\n</div>\n </div>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<p>Granted by the equipment:</p><ul style=\"list-style: none;\">\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-uncommon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/The_Whispering_Promise\" title=\"The Whispering Promise\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/55/Ring_F_1_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Ring_F_1_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/55/Ring_F_1_Unfaded_Icon.png/45px-Ring_F_1_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/5/55/Ring_F_1_Unfaded_Icon.png/60px-Ring_F_1_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/55/Ring_F_1_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Ring_F_1_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/5/55/Ring_F_1_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/The_Whispering_Promise\" title=\"The Whispering Promise\">The Whispering Promise</a></span></li>\n</ul>\n</div> <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip\">\n<ul><li>Applies the same condition as the standard <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Bless\" title=\"Bless\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c4/Bless_Icon.webp/20px-Bless_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/c4/Bless_Icon.webp/30px-Bless_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/c4/Bless_Icon.webp/40px-Bless_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Bless\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c4/Bless_Icon.webp/20px-Bless_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/c/c4/Bless_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Bless\" title=\"Bless\">Bless</a> spell, and therefore cannot stack with it.\n<ul><li>Despite also being called <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Bless\" title=\"Bless\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c4/Bless_Icon.webp/20px-Bless_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/c4/Bless_Icon.webp/30px-Bless_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/c4/Bless_Icon.webp/40px-Bless_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Bless\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c4/Bless_Icon.webp/20px-Bless_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/c/c4/Bless_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Bless\" title=\"Bless\">Bless</a>, this buff is not enhanced by the <span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-uncommon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Staff_of_Arcane_Blessing\" title=\"Staff of Arcane Blessing\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/9/91/Magic_Staff_A_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-Magic_Staff_A_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/9/91/Magic_Staff_A_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Magic_Staff_A_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/9/91/Magic_Staff_A_Unfaded_Icon.png/40px-Magic_Staff_A_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/9/91/Magic_Staff_A_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-Magic_Staff_A_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/9/91/Magic_Staff_A_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Staff_of_Arcane_Blessing\" title=\"Staff of Arcane Blessing\">Staff of Arcane Blessing</a>.</li></ul></li>\n<li>Multi-target healing abilities, such as <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Mass_Healing_Word\" title=\"Mass Healing Word\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f8/Mass_Healing_Word_Icon.webp/20px-Mass_Healing_Word_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/f8/Mass_Healing_Word_Icon.webp/30px-Mass_Healing_Word_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/f8/Mass_Healing_Word_Icon.webp/40px-Mass_Healing_Word_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Mass Healing Word\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f8/Mass_Healing_Word_Icon.webp/20px-Mass_Healing_Word_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/f8/Mass_Healing_Word_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Mass_Healing_Word\" title=\"Mass Healing Word\">Mass Healing Word</a> or a thrown <span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-common\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Potion_of_Healing\" title=\"Potion of Healing\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/04/POT_Potion_of_Healing_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-POT_Potion_of_Healing_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/04/POT_Potion_of_Healing_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-POT_Potion_of_Healing_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/0/04/POT_Potion_of_Healing_Unfaded_Icon.png/40px-POT_Potion_of_Healing_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/04/POT_Potion_of_Healing_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-POT_Potion_of_Healing_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/04/POT_Potion_of_Healing_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Potion_of_Healing\" title=\"Potion of Healing\">Potion of Healing</a>, bless all affected creatures (potentially including the caster).</li>\n<li>Drinking a <span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-common\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Potion_of_Healing\" title=\"Potion of Healing\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/04/POT_Potion_of_Healing_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-POT_Potion_of_Healing_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/04/POT_Potion_of_Healing_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-POT_Potion_of_Healing_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/0/04/POT_Potion_of_Healing_Unfaded_Icon.png/40px-POT_Potion_of_Healing_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/04/POT_Potion_of_Healing_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-POT_Potion_of_Healing_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/04/POT_Potion_of_Healing_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Potion_of_Healing\" title=\"Potion of Healing\">Potion of Healing</a> counts as healing oneself and triggers the effect of the ring as well.</li>\n<li>The Bless effect is applied even if the target being healed is already at full health.</li>\n<li>Healing effects from the <span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-very-rare\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Ring_of_Regeneration\" title=\"Ring of Regeneration\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e2/Ring_of_Regeneration_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-Ring_of_Regeneration_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/e2/Ring_of_Regeneration_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Ring_of_Regeneration_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/e/e2/Ring_of_Regeneration_Unfaded_Icon.png/40px-Ring_of_Regeneration_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e2/Ring_of_Regeneration_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-Ring_of_Regeneration_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/e/e2/Ring_of_Regeneration_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Ring_of_Regeneration\" title=\"Ring of Regeneration\">Ring of Regeneration</a>, <span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-legendary\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Helm_of_Balduran\" title=\"Helm of Balduran\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/9/94/Helm_of_Balduran_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-Helm_of_Balduran_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/9/94/Helm_of_Balduran_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Helm_of_Balduran_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/9/94/Helm_of_Balduran_Unfaded_Icon.png/40px-Helm_of_Balduran_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/9/94/Helm_of_Balduran_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-Helm_of_Balduran_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/9/94/Helm_of_Balduran_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Helm_of_Balduran\" title=\"Helm of Balduran\">Helm of Balduran</a>, or taking a <a href=\"/wiki/Short_Rest\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Short Rest\">Short Rest</a> all count as healing oneself and trigger the effect of the ring as well.</li>\n<li>The self-healing from <a href=\"/wiki/Life_Domain\" title=\"Life Domain\">Life Domain</a> Cleric's <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Blessed_Healer\" title=\"Blessed Healer\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3f/Generic_Healing_Icon.webp/20px-Generic_Healing_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/3f/Generic_Healing_Icon.webp/30px-Generic_Healing_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/3/3f/Generic_Healing_Icon.webp/40px-Generic_Healing_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Blessed Healer\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3f/Generic_Healing_Icon.webp/20px-Generic_Healing_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/3/3f/Generic_Healing_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Blessed_Healer\" title=\"Blessed Healer\">Blessed Healer</a> does not trigger the effect.</li>\n<li>Gaining <a href=\"/wiki/Temporary_hit_points\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Temporary hit points\">temporary hit points</a> does not count as healing and therefore does not trigger the effect.</li></ul>\n</div>   \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714195230\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.096 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.110 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 4362/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 39445/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 15911/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 25/200\nExpensive p